9-This file is sole design reference for implementers. Primary source is `improvements/Portfolio improvement_ Deslopify-handoff/portfolio-improvement-deslopify/project/Deslopify Jungle.dc.html`, especially Turn 2 / `#2a`. `Deslopify Lookdev.html` supplies renderer, shader, layout, and tier values. The primary Turn 2 four-card data below overrides Lookdev's three-card sample data.
