+# Changelog
+
+All notable changes to this project are documented here.
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Fixed
+
+- **CODEX:** Deslopify restart now restores vines, tags, and card visuals.
+- **CODEX:** Deslopify exhibit now uses `Details, README & Code`, and card wipe shader edges are GLSL-safe.
+- **CODEX:** Card wipes begin when cards clear, with cached scene-loop state and unchanged HUD publication.
+- **CODEX:** Disposed labels ignore late font redraws, preventing detached geometry leaks.
+- **CODEX:** Removed unused `bigLeafPlant` and `groundFern` flora exports and specs.
+- **CODEX:** Added stats-only south-bridge teleport coverage proving arch traversal enables Deslopify.
